# Token budget.  The design doc targets ~45 tokens/hit; measured against the estimator below a
# 4-line hit with a real PH government title lands at ~55, because the titles are long
# ("Supply and Delivery of ... for the ... of the Province of ...").  So: 62 is the enforced
# mean, 78 the per-hit hard cap, and format_hit() trims (snippet first, then title) to hold it.
# Enforcing a number we can actually hold beats printing one we can't.
